@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Student" as student
actor "Administrator" as admin

rectangle "Smart Campus System" {

  usecase "View Available Rooms" as UC_View
  usecase "Book Room" as UC_Book
  usecase "Cancel Booking" as UC_Cancel
  usecase "Send Confirmation" as UC_Confirm
  usecase "Block Room" as UC_Block
  usecase "Unblock Room" as UC_Unblock
  usecase "Review Room Usage" as UC_Review

  student -- UC_View
  student -- UC_Book
  student -- UC_Cancel

  admin -- UC_Block
  admin -- UC_Unblock
  admin -- UC_Review

  ' why: a successful booking produces a confirmation according to R4
  UC_Book .> UC_Confirm : <<include>>

  ' why: the approved story requires confirmation after a cancellation
  UC_Cancel .> UC_Confirm : <<include>>
}

note right of UC_Book
R1: Future start, duration > 0 and <= 2 hours
R2: Active bookings for the same room cannot overlap
R3: Blocked room cannot accept a new booking
R4: Successful booking produces a confirmation
end note

@enduml